### ====================================================
### OpenAI Integration Tests
### ====================================================
### Prerequisites:
###   1. App running: ./mvnw spring-boot:run
###   2. @baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
###   3. Obtain a JWT token from /auth/login and set @token
### ====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Test OpenAI API Connectivity
### Verifies the API key is set and the model is reachable.
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Trigger an analysis for a PR
### Replace prId with an actual pull request mongo _id
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prId": "REPLACE_WITH_PULL_REQUEST_ID"
}

###

### 3. Get analysis results for a PR
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/results/REPLACE_WITH_PULL_REQUEST_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get analysis status
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/status/REPLACE_WITH_ANALYSIS_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
